---
// CaseStudies.astro - Powering Connectivity for Modern Businesses
---

<section class="casestudies-section" id="case-studies">
  <div class="casestudies-inner">
    <div class="section-badge">Case Studies</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">
      Powering Connectivity for <span class="highlight">Modern Businesses</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="casestudies-grid">
      <!-- Angel Watch - featured large -->
      <div class="case-card case-card--featured">
        <div class="case-card-bg" style="background-image: url('https://spenza.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/client-background-1-1.png')"></div>
        <div class="case-card-logos">
          <img src="/images/trusted-leaders/Angel-Watch.png.webp" alt="Angel Watch" class="case-logo" />
          <div class="case-spenza-logo">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none"><path d="M20 4L36 30H4L20 4Z" fill="#FF4500"/><rect x="10" y="22" width="20" height="6" rx="3" fill="white" fill-opacity="0.8"/></svg>
            <span style="color:white;font-weight:800;font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:-0.5px;">SPENZA</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-card-content">
          <h3 class="case-title">Angel Watch</h3>
          <p class="case-desc">Learn how Angel Watch scaled IoT connectivity, delivered a world-class customer experience, and reduced cost with Spenza</p>
          <a href="/telecom/angel-watch-iot-business-casestudy/" class="btn btn-primary">See How</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Butlr -->
      <div class="case-card">
        <div class="case-card-bg" style="background-image: url('https://spenza.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ac919e663b0ebd7973d805bc7598228174a7a048.png')"></div>
        <div class="case-card-content">
          <h3 class="case-title">Butlr Story</h3>
          <p class="case-desc">Discover how Butlr lowered telecom costs and reduced time to market from 60 days to just 7 days with Spenza's connectivity platform.</p>
          <a href="/spenza-product/butlr-iot-spenza-casestudy/" class="btn btn-primary">See How</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- MSP-A -->
      <div class="case-card">
        <div class="case-card-bg" style="background-image: url('https://spenza.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/5358473bd3ca3571e1fb713b06c32f178a163818.png')"></div>
        <div class="case-card-content">
          <h3 class="case-title">MSP-A Story</h3>
          <p class="case-desc">See how MSP-A achieved 3X faster growth using Spenza's reseller management platform. Streamlining connectivity, billing, and partner operations.</p>
          <a href="/spenza-product/proxy-reseller-growth-spenza/" class="btn btn-primary">See How</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .casestudies-section {
    background: #f5f5f7;
    padding: 96px 2rem;
  }

  .casestudies-inner {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1.5px solid #FF4500;
    color: #FF4500;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 20px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: #FF4500;
  }

  .casestudies-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .case-card {
    background: #1a1a2e;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 400px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .case-card-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    opacity: 0.45;
  }

  .case-card-logos {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    left: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .case-logo {
    height: 40px;
    width: auto;
    filter: brightness(10);
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .case-spenza-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .case-card-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .case-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .case-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #FF4500;
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #e03d00;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .casestudies-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .case-card {
      min-height: 280px;
    }
  }
</style>
